ends 1 month to pillage adjacent Cities of the selected Faction, transferring 7% of their Gold and Supplies to our Capital."},"coolTime":"30"}],"warSkills":[],"battleCards":[{"id":"1003305","name":{"zh":"横斩","en":"Horizontal Slash"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"长剑基本招式，运用蛮力的横斩。","en":"A basic longsword technique, a brute-force horizontal slash."},"ap":"3","mp":"400"},{"id":"1009002","name":{"zh":"冲步","en":"Dash Step"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"身法技能，可以瞬间接近或远离目标。移动距离比普通的翻滚更远。","en":"A movement skill that can instantly approach or move away from the target. Move Distance is greater than a standard roll."},"ap":"1"}],"debateCards":[{"id":"1002201","name":{"zh":"大喝","en":"Thundercry"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"群体攻击牌，对所有敌人造成100点伤害。","en":"AoE Attack Card. Deals 100 damage to all enemies."},"ap":"3"}],"warSouls":[],"battleSouls":[],"debateSouls":[],"soulPoints":{"war":7300,"battle":8000,"debate":3400},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1006002","name":{"zh":"竹柄木枪","en":"Bamboo-Shaft Wooden Spear"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"虽是竹制兵器，但是意外的结实耐用。","en":"Though made of bamboo, it is surprisingly sturdy and durable."},"atkVal":"8","price":"7000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1013905","name":{"zh":"锦绣布衣·甲","en":"Embroidered Cloth Robe - I"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"采用了普通的面料并进行了纹饰处理的布衣，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A cloth garment made from ordinary fabric and adorned with patterns, with simple trim also added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"2","mp":"340","price":"1200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1024605","name":{"zh":"儒巾","en":"Confucian Kerchief"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"学府中最常见的巾帻，掌柜文书等要职的官员也有佩戴。","en":"The most common headcloth in academies, also worn by officials holding key posts in charge of records and documents."},"defenceVal":"2","mp":"850","price":"2800","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001015","name":{"zh":"汗血","en":"Sweatblood"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"西域进贡的纯种汗血宝马，皮肤薄，血管可见，冲刺时如流血汗。","en":"A purebred blood-sweating horse presented as tribute from the Western Regions, with thin skin and visible veins that appear to sweat blood at full gallop."},"price":"10000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1046715","code":"0"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI112815","name":{"zh":"鲜卑慕容氏","en":"The Murong clan of Xianbei"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑族东部支系。先祖莫护跋于曹魏初年率部迁居辽西，曾随毌丘俭、司马懿征讨割据辽东的公孙渊，因功受曹魏封为率义王，始建国于棘城之北。至西晋时，慕容廆进一步发展，其子孙在十六国时期建立前燕、后燕、西燕、南燕等政权。","en":"Descended from the Donghu, an eastern branch of the Xianbei tribe. In the early Cao Wei era, their ancestor Mohuba led his tribe to relocate to Liaoxi. He took part alongside Guanqiu Jian and Sima Yi in the expedition against Gongsun Yuan in Liaodong, and was enfeoffed by Cao Wei as the King of Guided Righteousness for his merits, initially establishing his domain North of Jicheng. In the Western Jin, Murong Hui expanded their influence further, and his descendants founded regimes including Former Yan, Later Yan, Western Yan, and Southern Yan during the Sixteen Kingdoms period."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"5","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"慕容吐延","height":"较高","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,89,53,55,67,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,89,53,